#
#   block_formatting_context_4 - Layout::BlockFormattingContext: fieldsets, box model metrics,
#                                clearance and placing block-level boxes
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/BlockFormattingContext.cpp (lines 1029-1228): the layout of a
#       fieldset with a rendered legend, the vertical and horizontal box model metrics of a box,
#       clearing floats (clearance), and placing a block-level box in normal flow vertically and
#       horizontally (beside the floats it must avoid, honoring the -libweb-center/right
#       text-align values).
